Subject: [PATCH] J714s image: hyprland-m5 0.57.2-5 (hyprgraphics 0.7.0, held
 pointer)

The edge channel moved to hyprgraphics 0.7.0 (libhyprgraphics.so=6), and
hyprland-m5 0.57.2-4 needs libhyprgraphics.so=5, so the set no longer
resolved. hyprland-m5 0.57.2-5 (797fa9f1..., 53015521 bytes) from
betizzel/omarchy-m5 eb93d7b5: the same patches on Omarchy's 0.57.2-7 recipe
(its rebuild against hyprgraphics 0.7.0 and the held-pointer patch, #3604),
built natively on the J714s in a clean chroot (core, extra, alarm).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
